<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $1.00/1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $1.00/1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts slow, $1.00 to mostly $1.50 lower. Top $54.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    53.50-54.50, mostly 54.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 50-1.00 lower; heavier weights not fully established at mid-session.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.50, few to 46.50</p>
</text>
